Title: Reminder: General Assembly of EMPOWER is being held on 27/03/2024
Date: 27-Mar-24
Content:  Emirates Central Cooling Systems Corporation PJSC (EMPOWER) has issued an invitation to its shareholders for the Annual General Meeting (AGM) to be held on 27 March 2024. The AGM will cover several topics, including:
- Approving the appointment of the Secretary of the meeting and Dubai Financial Market as votes collector;
- Reviewing the Board of Directors' report on EMPOWER's activities and financial position for the year ended 31 December 2023;
- Considering and approving the external auditor's report on EMPOWER's financial position for the year ended 31 December 2023;
- Ratifying and approving the Board of Directors' decision to pay interim cash dividends for the first half of 2023 and rec

ng the Board of Directors' decision to pay interim cash dividends for the first half of 2023 and recommending an interim cash dividend for the second half of 2023;
- Approving EMPOWER's dividend policy and authorizing the Board of Directors to pay an interim cash dividend for the first half of 2024;
- Considering and approving the Board of Directors' recommendation concerning the Board remuneration for the year ended 31 December 2023;
- Discharging the members of the Board of Directors and the external auditors from any liability for the financial year ended 31 December 2023;
- Approving variations in audit fees for additional time and resources spent on auditing new subsidiaries and additional reporting;
